docs {
  # Token Price

  Provides administrative control over the platform token price and broadcasts real-time updates across connected clients.

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Path | Action |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `PUT` | `/api/v1/admin/token-price` | Update platform token price in Toman |
}
